      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 18 years 1 week ago",
      "body": "I started taking Aaron to storytime at our local library.  It is pretty neat, they have it once a week, and they pick a theme.  We sing songs, read a story, watch a movie, and do a craft...that all goes with the theme.  Todays theme was pirates!  Aaron loves because after he gets to checkout some books.",
